  "body_html": "<h1>Survives</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ndef Survives (G : StrategicGame N U) : ℕ → (i : N) → G.strategy i → Prop | 0 =&gt; fun _ _ =&gt; True | n + 1 =&gt; fun i s =&gt; G.Survives n i s ∧ ¬ ∃ t : G.strategy i, G.Survives n i t ∧ ∀ σ : G.Profile, (∀ j, G.Survives n j (σ j)) → G.payoff (deviate σ i s) i &lt; G.payoff (deviate σ i t) i /-- Survival at round n+1 implies survival at round n. -/</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>IsNashEquilibrium.survives</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n</ul>",
